# Gated Registration + Permission-Based Access Control

## Summary of Changes from Original Design

| Area | Before | After |
|------|--------|-------|
| Authorization | `portal_role` enum (member/admin/super_admin) | **Permission-based** — positions → permissions, APIs check permissions |
| Event creation | `can_create_events` boolean on memberships | `create_events` **permission** (assignable via position or direct grant) |
| Registration | Open Google OAuth, anyone with @nirmauni.ac.in | **Gated** — IEEE Membership ID required, admin/MDO approval |
| MDO | Didn't exist | **Position** with `approve_registrations` permission |
| SuperAdmin | Was a portal_role | `is_super_admin` flag on profiles (global bypass) |
| Member validation | None | **Pre-approved members table** — MDO pre-loads IDs for auto-approval |

