### Manual Testing
1. **Signup (pre-approved):** Enter a pre-loaded membership ID → auto-approved → dashboard
2. **Signup (unknown ID):** Enter an unknown ID → pending → waiting screen
3. **Login (email/password):** Approved user logs in → dashboard
4. **Login (Google):** Approved user → dashboard (bypass)
5. **Google (new user):** First-time Google user → /complete-registration → fill IEEE ID
6. **Pending redirect:** Authenticated but pending user → any page → redirects to /pending
7. **Rejected redirect:** Rejected user → any page → redirects to /rejected
8. **Permission check:** User without `create_events` → cannot create event
9. **SuperAdmin bypass:** SuperAdmin can do everything in any branch
